      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 239,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "rules-08-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/rules-08-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二还打造了一条长长的马槽，隔成几十个小槽，一马一格，互不干涉。槽沿上钉着品级木牌。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 1848,
          "durationInFrames": 239
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rules-09",
      "actId": "rules",
      "oldStartFrame": 2112,
      "oldEndFrame": 2448,
      "startFrame": 2112,
      "endFrame": 2448,
      "durationFrames": 336,
      "targetSeconds": 14,
      "actualSeconds": 13.21,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 317,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "rules-09-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/rules-09-narr.mp3",
          "text": "可马哪懂人间的论资排辈？这一槽草，吃得跟打仗一样。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 2112,
          "durationInFrames": 141
        },
        {
          "id": "rules-09-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "店小二",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/rules-09-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "哎哎，三品马，怎么把嘴伸到二品槽里了？五品马，放着青草不吃，干吗吃枯草？",
          "relativeStartFrame": 149,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 2261,
          "durationInFrames": 168
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rules-10",
      "actId": "rules",
      "oldStartFrame": 2448,
      "oldEndFrame": 2760,
      "startFrame": 2448,
      "endFrame": 2760,
      "durationFrames": 312,
      "targetSeconds": 13,
      "actualSeconds": 12.14,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 292,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "rules-10-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/rules-10-narr.mp3",
          "text": "日子一长，马匹都被训练得规规矩矩，各吃各槽，少有越礼。达官显贵看在眼里，会心一笑。这碗饭算是端稳了。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 2448,
          "durationInFrames": 292
        }
      ]
    },
    {
