        {
          "id": "exception-01-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-01-narr.mp3",
          "text": "这天，一个刀疤脸中年人，骑着一匹瘸腿白马来了。黑脸上一道长刀疤。马脖子挂着铃铛，一走一歪，叮当乱响。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 2760,
          "durationInFrames": 296
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "exception-02",
      "actId": "exception",
