          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-03-narr.mp3",
          "text": "他脸上堆笑，心里却冷。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 3288,
          "durationInFrames": 61
        },
        {
          "id": "exception-03-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "店小二",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-03-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "客官里面请，我给马添些草料。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 69,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 3357,
          "durationInFrames": 62
        }
      ]
    },
    {
