        {
          "id": "exception-05-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-05-narr.mp3",
          "text": "这话油滑，刀疤脸却没笑。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 3744,
          "durationInFrames": 77
        },
        {
          "id": "exception-05-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "店小二",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-05-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "我两条腿的，怎敢欺负四条腿的？它要发起怒来，踢我一脚，我怎么追得上？",
          "relativeStartFrame": 85,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 3829,
          "durationInFrames": 153
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "exception-06",
      "actId": "exception",
      "oldStartFrame": 4008,
