          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-06-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二把瘸马牵到最靠西的槽子，扔下一把枯草，就进店去了。那槽子又偏又冷。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 4008,
          "durationInFrames": 200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "exception-07",
      "actId": "exception",
      "oldStartFrame": 4248,
      "oldEndFrame": 4464,
      "startFrame": 4248,
