          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-07-narr.mp3",
          "text": "一个时辰过去，二品大员赵大人酒足饭饱，起身回府。这位赵大人，最讲排场。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 4248,
          "durationInFrames": 216
