          "id": "exception-11-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/exception-11-narr.mp3",
          "text": "赵大人只说了句“下不为例”，拂袖而去。店小二擦了一把冷汗。",
