      "voiceEndFrame": 237,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "contest-04-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-04-narr.mp3",
          "text": "这天刀疤脸又来了。店小二把缰绳在木桩上系了个死扣：这回看你往哪跑！他使出了吃奶的劲。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 6103,
          "durationInFrames": 237
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "contest-05",
      "actId": "contest",
      "oldStartFrame": 6360,
      "oldEndFrame": 6528,
      "startFrame": 6367,
      "endFrame": 6493,
      "durationFrames": 126,
      "targetSeconds": 7,
      "actualSeconds": 5.18,
      "deltaSeconds": -1.75,
      "voiceEndFrame": 125,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "contest-05-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-05-narr.mp3",
          "text": "不巧，今天店里来了一位一品大员。真正的大人物。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 6367,
          "durationInFrames": 125
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "contest-06",
      "actId": "contest",
      "oldStartFrame": 6528,
      "oldEndFrame": 6816,
      "startFrame": 6493,
      "endFrame": 6781,
      "durationFrames": 288,
      "targetSeconds": 12,
      "actualSeconds": 11.6,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 279,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "contest-06-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-06-narr.mp3",
          "text": "一品大员饭后到后院，脸色骤变：那匹瘸马，又蹭到最靠东的槽子，吃起了细粮嫩草！他简直不敢相信自己的眼睛。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 6493,
          "durationInFrames": 279
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "contest-07",
      "actId": "contest",
      "oldStartFrame": 6816,
      "oldEndFrame": 7080,
      "startFrame": 6781,
      "endFrame": 7045,
      "durationFrames": 264,
      "targetSeconds": 11,
      "actualSeconds": 10.35,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 249,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "contest-07-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-07-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二跑到木桩前一看，娘啊，木桩被蹭掉一层，缰绳也有磨损——这破马会用嘴解扣！心都凉了半截。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 6781,
          "durationInFrames": 249
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "contest-08",
      "actId": "contest",
      "oldStartFrame": 7080,
      "oldEndFrame": 7344,
      "startFrame": 7045,
      "endFrame": 7309,
      "durationFrames": 264,
      "targetSeconds": 11,
      "actualSeconds": 10.84,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 260,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "contest-08-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-08-narr.mp3",
          "text": "一品大员的脸，黑得能滴出水来。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 7045,
          "durationInFrames": 80
        },
        {
          "id": "contest-08-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "一品大员",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-08-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "怎么？难道当今圣上今日不在宫中用膳，跑来你这饭馆寻乐？",
          "relativeStartFrame": 88,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 7133,
          "durationInFrames": 172
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "contest-09",
      "actId": "contest",
      "oldStartFrame": 7344,
      "oldEndFrame": 7656,
      "startFrame": 7309,
      "endFrame": 7657,
      "durationFrames": 348,
      "targetSeconds": 13,
      "actualSeconds": 14.32,
      "deltaSeconds": 1.5,
      "voiceEndFrame": 344,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "contest-09-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-09-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二扑通跪倒，磕头如鸡啄米。一品大员一甩袖子，走了。店小二的魂都吓飞了。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 7309,
          "durationInFrames": 226
        },
        {
          "id": "contest-09-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "一品大员",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-09-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "下次再看到这破马扫本大人的兴……",
          "relativeStartFrame": 228,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 7537,
          "durationInFrames": 116
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "contest-10",
      "actId": "contest",
      "oldStartFrame": 7656,
      "oldEndFrame": 7920,
      "startFrame": 7657,
      "endFrame": 7920,
      "durationFrames": 263,
      "targetSeconds": 11,
      "actualSeconds": 9.62,
      "deltaSeconds": -0.04,
      "voiceEndFrame": 231,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "contest-10-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "店小二",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-10-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "客官，您那良驹太不安分，能不能别带它来？",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 7657,
          "durationInFrames": 95
        },
        {
          "id": "contest-10-dlg-02",
          "speaker": "刀疤脸",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/contest-10-dlg-02.mp3",
          "text": "一派胡言！我与赛赤兔感情深厚，人在马在！",
          "relativeStartFrame": 99,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 7756,
          "durationInFrames": 132
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-01",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 7920,
      "oldEndFrame": 8184,
      "startFrame": 7920,
      "endFrame": 8207,
      "durationFrames": 287,
      "targetSeconds": 11,
      "actualSeconds": 11.79,
      "deltaSeconds": 0.96,
      "voiceEndFrame": 283,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-01-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-01-narr.mp3",
          "text": "这回，店小二在马头上多加一根粗绳，桩上系死扣，还派小童死死盯着。看你还怎么解！这回是双保险。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 7920,
          "durationInFrames": 283
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-02",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 8184,
      "oldEndFrame": 8400,
      "startFrame": 8207,
      "endFrame": 8416,
      "durationFrames": 209,
      "targetSeconds": 9,
      "actualSeconds": 8.43,
      "deltaSeconds": -0.29,
      "voiceEndFrame": 203,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-02-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-02-narr.mp3",
          "text": "瘸马挣不脱，脾气却上来了，梗着脖子，半点草料不吃。它宁可饿着，也不低头。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 8207,
          "durationInFrames": 203
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-03",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 8400,
      "oldEndFrame": 8640,
      "startFrame": 8416,
      "endFrame": 8662,
      "durationFrames": 246,
      "targetSeconds": 10,
      "actualSeconds": 10.09,
      "deltaSeconds": 0.25,
      "voiceEndFrame": 243,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-03-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-03-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二心里痛快：“不吃才好呢！你主人一碟花生米，还不够你吃草的钱！”小算盘打得噼啪响。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 8416,
          "durationInFrames": 243
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-04",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 8640,
      "oldEndFrame": 8928,
      "startFrame": 8662,
      "endFrame": 8949,
      "durationFrames": 287,
      "targetSeconds": 12,
      "actualSeconds": 11.46,
      "deltaSeconds": -0.04,
      "voiceEndFrame": 276,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-04-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-04-narr.mp3",
          "text": "可没美几天，怪事来了：那些达官显贵的马，见瘸马不进食，竟都立在一边乖乖候着，谁也不敢低头。这叫什么事儿？",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 8662,
          "durationInFrames": 276
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-05",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 8928,
      "oldEndFrame": 9216,
      "startFrame": 8949,
      "endFrame": 9261,
      "durationFrames": 312,
      "targetSeconds": 12,
      "actualSeconds": 12.85,
      "deltaSeconds": 1,
      "voiceEndFrame": 309,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-05-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-05-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二敲着槽沿：“吃啊！你们家主人多厉害，别让这破瘸马唬住了！”可众马还是胆战心惊，不敢动草。嗓子都喊哑了。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 8949,
          "durationInFrames": 309
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-06",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 9216,
      "oldEndFrame": 9456,
      "startFrame": 9261,
      "endFrame": 9501,
      "durationFrames": 240,
      "targetSeconds": 10,
      "actualSeconds": 9.72,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 234,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-06-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-06-narr.mp3",
          "text": "日子一长，马匹白天不敢吃，回府再猛补，一饿一撑，全都瘦了下去。马瘦毛长，瞒不住了。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 9261,
          "durationInFrames": 234
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-07",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 9456,
      "oldEndFrame": 9672,
      "startFrame": 9501,
      "endFrame": 9688,
      "durationFrames": 187,
      "targetSeconds": 9,
      "actualSeconds": 7.7,
      "deltaSeconds": -1.21,
      "voiceEndFrame": 185,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-07-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-07-narr.mp3",
          "text": "达官显贵察觉了，纷纷质问店小二：是不是照看马匹不周？一个个找上门来。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 9501,
          "durationInFrames": 185
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-08",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 9672,
      "oldEndFrame": 9936,
      "startFrame": 9688,
      "endFrame": 9952,
      "durationFrames": 264,
      "targetSeconds": 11,
      "actualSeconds": 10.87,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 261,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-08-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-08-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二不敢再瞒，把那瘸腿马的事，一五一十全说了。赵大人和几位官员一听，勃然大怒。纸包不住火。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 9688,
          "durationInFrames": 261
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hunger-09",
      "actId": "hunger",
      "oldStartFrame": 9936,
      "oldEndFrame": 10200,
      "startFrame": 9952,
      "endFrame": 10200,
      "durationFrames": 248,
      "targetSeconds": 11,
      "actualSeconds": 10.27,
      "deltaSeconds": -0.67,
      "voiceEndFrame": 247,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "hunger-09-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-09-narr.mp3",
          "text": "堂鼓一响，众人到齐。他们把刀疤脸叫到跟前。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 9952,
          "durationInFrames": 124
        },
        {
          "id": "hunger-09-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "赵大人",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/hunger-09-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "你好大的胆子，竟敢拿一匹瘸马吓唬本大人的坐骑！",
          "relativeStartFrame": 132,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 10084,
          "durationInFrames": 115
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-01",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 10200,
      "oldEndFrame": 10512,
      "startFrame": 10200,
      "endFrame": 10516,
      "durationFrames": 316,
      "targetSeconds": 13,
      "actualSeconds": 13.02,
      "deltaSeconds": 0.17,
      "voiceEndFrame": 313,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-01-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-01-narr.mp3",
          "text": "刀疤脸被带到堂前，赵大人拍案而起：“你好大的胆子，竟敢拿一匹瘸腿马来吓唬本大人的坐骑！你该当何罪？”堂上鸦雀无声。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 10200,
          "durationInFrames": 313
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-02",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 10512,
      "oldEndFrame": 10704,
      "startFrame": 10516,
      "endFrame": 10725,
      "durationFrames": 209,
      "targetSeconds": 8,
      "actualSeconds": 8.54,
      "deltaSeconds": 0.71,
      "voiceEndFrame": 205,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-02-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-02-narr.mp3",
          "text": "刀疤脸不慌不忙。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 10516,
          "durationInFrames": 46
        },
        {
          "id": "truth-02-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "刀疤脸",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-02-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "大人明鉴，在下只是骑马来吃饭。马不吃草，这有何罪？",
          "relativeStartFrame": 48,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 10564,
          "durationInFrames": 157
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-03",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 10704,
      "oldEndFrame": 10920,
      "startFrame": 10725,
      "endFrame": 10953,
      "durationFrames": 228,
      "targetSeconds": 9,
      "actualSeconds": 9.37,
      "deltaSeconds": 0.5,
      "voiceEndFrame": 225,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-03-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-03-narr.mp3",
          "text": "赵大人气得抽出长剑，挥向刀疤脸的右臂。刀疤脸抬手去挡——“喀嚓”一声！剑风一闪。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 10725,
          "durationInFrames": 225
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-04",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 10920,
      "oldEndFrame": 11160,
      "startFrame": 10953,
      "endFrame": 11200,
      "durationFrames": 247,
      "targetSeconds": 10,
      "actualSeconds": 10.15,
      "deltaSeconds": 0.29,
      "voiceEndFrame": 244,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-04-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-04-narr.mp3",
          "text": "右臂应声而断，却不见半点鲜血。众人仔细一看：那竟是一条木头做的假肢！众人都愣住了。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 10953,
          "durationInFrames": 244
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-05",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 11160,
      "oldEndFrame": 11328,
      "startFrame": 11200,
      "endFrame": 11359,
      "durationFrames": 159,
      "targetSeconds": 7,
      "actualSeconds": 6.04,
      "deltaSeconds": -0.38,
      "voiceEndFrame": 145,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-05-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-05-narr.mp3",
          "text": "店小二吓得结巴。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 11200,
          "durationInFrames": 45
        },
        {
          "id": "truth-05-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "店小二",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-05-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "没……没胳膊啊……断臂人骑瘸腿马，倒是般配。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 53,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 11253,
          "durationInFrames": 92
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-06",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 11328,
      "oldEndFrame": 11616,
      "startFrame": 11359,
      "endFrame": 11599,
      "durationFrames": 240,
      "targetSeconds": 12,
      "actualSeconds": 9.94,
      "deltaSeconds": -2,
      "voiceEndFrame": 239,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-06-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-06-narr.mp3",
          "text": "刀疤脸仰天长啸，笑声震得堂上众人面面相觑。这一问，问出了十几年的旧账。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 11359,
          "durationInFrames": 198
        },
        {
          "id": "truth-06-dlg-01",
          "speaker": "赵大人",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-06-dlg-01.mp3",
          "text": "你到底是谁？",
          "relativeStartFrame": 206,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 11565,
          "durationInFrames": 33
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-07",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 11616,
      "oldEndFrame": 11904,
      "startFrame": 11599,
      "endFrame": 11887,
      "durationFrames": 288,
      "targetSeconds": 12,
      "actualSeconds": 11.96,
      "deltaSeconds": 0,
      "voiceEndFrame": 288,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-07-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-07-narr.mp3",
          "text": "十几年前，我为朝廷横戈跃马，把叛军杀得丢盔卸甲，生擒贼首。可一次激战，我中了毒箭，郎中只能砍去我的右臂。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 11599,
          "durationInFrames": 288
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-08",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 11904,
      "oldEndFrame": 12168,
      "startFrame": 11887,
      "endFrame": 12167,
      "durationFrames": 280,
      "targetSeconds": 11,
      "actualSeconds": 11.53,
      "deltaSeconds": 0.67,
      "voiceEndFrame": 277,
      "voiceFits": true,
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "truth-08-narr",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "staticPath": "tiaocaoma/audio/voice/truth-08-narr.mp3",
          "text": "朝廷见我不能再上马，兔死狗烹，把我抛弃了。我的战马也中了地钩刀，从此瘸了。一将功成，万骨枯。",
          "relativeStartFrame": 0,
          "absoluteStartFrame": 11887,
          "durationInFrames": 277
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "truth-09",
      "actId": "truth",
      "oldStartFrame": 12168,
      "oldEndFrame": 12456,
      "startFrame": 12167,
      "endFrame": 12455,
      "durationFrames": 288,
